<body>
    <h1>Coastals Power Order Splitting Solution Design for Salesforce Reven=
ue Cloud Implementation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"d911e5ca8612"><strong>Power Order Splitting</strong>=
&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"4ce24df1ceef">Solution Design Document&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"59d9f6bf9111">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"25d9290c020d">Salesforce Revenue Cloud Implementation&nbsp;<=
/p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"8734ad3743a4">
<li local-id=3D"e10dcde6eb6b">
<p local-id=3D"ffd2647d58b7"><strong>Executive Summary</strong>&nbsp;</p></=
li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"4e8c5d0efa43">This document outlines the solution design for=
 the Power Order Splitting feature within the Salesforce Revenue Cloud impl=
ementation. The feature automates the splitting of order lines for Power so=
lution group products when quantities exceed one, ensuring proper hardware =
and partition record management.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"610245ef0044">The solution supports two distinct splitting b=
ehaviors based on product configuration: sharing hardware across split line=
s or cloning hardware for each individual line. This flexibility accommodat=
es various business scenarios while maintaining data integrity and audit tr=
aceability.&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"dfeb3c46e2f1">
<li local-id=3D"1fa1591528ef">
<p local-id=3D"a89158696016"><strong>Business Requirements</strong>&nbsp;</=
p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"e6b2778bd52c"><strong>2.1 Background</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"4ab174619492">Power products require special handling during=
 order processing. When a customer orders multiple units of a Power product=
 (quantity &gt; 1), each unit must be tracked individually for licensing, m=
aintenance, and hardware inventory purposes. This requires splitting the or=
der line into individual quantity-1 lines.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"9a9f7561b6b1"><strong>2.2 Functional Requirements</strong>&n=
bsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"3c23bd02-ff78-4107-b789-9089a05dde96">
<li local-id=3D"8037b98c-4301-4255-b94d-d6b801da6801">
<p local-id=3D"d359da2d27e1">The system shall automatically split Power pro=
duct order lines when quantity exceeds one&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"782363c4-782e-4f4f-b38f-eafd731ebdf9">
<li local-id=3D"e0f853e5-43b7-4d1e-8e96-c4eb49cc8b5e">
<p local-id=3D"bd9e16421c80">Each split line shall have a quantity of exact=
ly one (1)&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"6de026d4-09d9-4a7d-bfd7-774443cdbadb">
<li local-id=3D"99c6c2e2-5603-4926-8520-4d6c3479ad32">
<p local-id=3D"b9f5370fd067">Manual Discount Amount shall be divided evenly=
 across all split lines&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"e1445255-ab1c-4998-bf11-a1536bcdae4f">
<li local-id=3D"a2295452-b80c-46d6-9c6c-cc01c25c1fcb">
<p local-id=3D"95d2530ada6a">Displaced ARR shall be divided evenly across a=
ll split lines&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"7b61b575-8d82-4a67-be14-e4c80ede904f">
<li local-id=3D"8db16076-d006-453d-bc55-3b2ca9f777de">
<p local-id=3D"5dd43ba6b839">Hardware records shall be shared or cloned bas=
ed on product configuration&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"6" local-id=3D"068b2ec1-f20a-4381-b2fc-541c78e78608">
<li local-id=3D"d099d727-fc03-4b8d-b95d-86cfe38a065c">
<p local-id=3D"be3105820612">Partition records shall always be cloned for e=
ach split line&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"7" local-id=3D"1d862f82-1b5e-4a39-a154-1cc268f96978">
<li local-id=3D"80d50dea-d7df-491c-aa28-2fa7efd607df">
<p local-id=3D"fa63e31ee3a1">Split lines shall maintain a reference to the =
original order item for audit purposes&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"c866266976b0"><strong>2.3 Split Type Behaviors</strong>&nbsp=
;</p>
<p local-id=3D"bfad58713c45">The system supports two split types, configure=
d at the product level:&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b087966b-7758-4bd4-88ca-b67=
5f27a95a3" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"30579afb-bd67-4cda-a9d1-f586185b3031">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"033698da-68e4-4200-b=
92e-f17915007a80" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"57bc88bfd8a2"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Split Type</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nb=
sp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"32977e36-98b0-4929-a=
b1b-4ede4eaf7c49" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"efc49e32acec"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Order Lines</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&n=
bsp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"aba0bac1-86ce-4d23-b=
c16-badbd1e87059" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c451961cd4ee"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Hardware</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp=
;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"e665d7cb-f60a-49a0-b=
fdd-e95eb9faad57" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f59f61341a25"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Partitions</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nb=
sp;</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"30af1f3f-a561-4a9b-a084-976326d9626e">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"b1fe1441-2ca8-4d32-9=
6b1-d3ab9a8a429d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2ec8de3d9830">Order Line Only&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"20b0d7d2-4e2c-494f-8=
891-d874b62b1806" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c35ed3b77738">Split to qty=3D1 each&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"c03a6ca8-7d57-406a-b=
0b6-25d90912c8c3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bb577a5725d7">SHARED - all lines reference same hardware&nbs=
p;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"91611cf2-3a7a-40aa-a=
360-a32d3b8ef626" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4edd20f8776">CLONED - each line gets own partition&nbsp;</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8258b03b-724d-45e5-b81e-16e548336b38">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"54042b03-3051-4d=
08-8164-472e2dbc4b74" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ae5e6a296a5">Order Line and Hardware&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"557625c4-a75a-48=
4e-a12f-fd19c545ff76" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eb769a4b77b3">Split to qty=3D1 each&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"b63979ad-e4ed-4d=
f3-b60e-67f685952d49" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"481b662bbb22">CLONED - each line gets own hardware&nbsp;</p>=
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"b61d60cc-a4cf-4d=
5f-bf7a-518685d3d4ba" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c18a738c65f9">CLONED - each line gets own partition&nbsp;</p=
></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"4c18535b8eeb">&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"a0aa910f623c">
<li local-id=3D"f83ee985509d">
<p local-id=3D"52fffaefca72"><strong>Solution Overview</strong>&nbsp;</p></=
li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"74455e2d213e"><strong>3.1 Architecture</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"27a99085201b">The solution consists of an Invocable Apex ser=
vice that can be called from Salesforce Flows. This architecture provides f=
lexibility for integration with existing Quote-to-Order conversion processe=
s while maintaining testability and separation of concerns.&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a5d9bc77-9759-4f1e-bd12-434=
529a75afc" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e278ddc4-ca4f-447b-b6f4-ab4cfa2a9d95">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"76287ec2-ab51-4fce-9=
58a-2aecf163e8c5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4a65574b9906"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Component</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbs=
p;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"a77b3043-76e0-43a6-b=
235-3de1b39c06a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ff8fcf09d30"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Description</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&n=
bsp;</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7d60a149-b645-48bd-a6b1-cc8754d448f3">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"4a3a8c3e-8c30-40d7-8=
c45-cca3b321f047" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a0b3f708572e">PowerOrderSplittingService&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"f7b85d41-2ecf-4369-9=
a9c-7d2af707a213" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"870a18297cd8">Main Apex service class with @InvocableMethod =
for Flow integration&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d6132bca-e040-405f-8d18-d5d227bfc1e1">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"e90b1daf-92fa-48=
06-895b-e8f9cd0a6f92" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c02c96b12a2">SplitRequest&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"9eb66c74-d069-48=
f6-9ae4-fa07b4503310" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7486c11d66e2">Input wrapper class containing Order ID for pr=
ocessing&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d06dc72-14d2-4ae4-bea9-5a04cac2ed9d">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"06d8e00f-132a-4eed-b=
af3-754f3b37188d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a32013b39fcc">SplitResult&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"f5d8ec47-c39e-41f4-8=
cbd-afc67fc4ec75" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d447289de0f0">Output wrapper with success status, counts, an=
d error messages&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c6287d3e-1490-42c4-8735-a539c1455d0a">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"c1953f20-2310-48=
7f-a88a-f94aefcf4c9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bba1ef8371dd">Quote-to-Order Flow&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"71796fbb-9d27-4d=
7b-8841-7e3a094ac0ed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"912e347f3913">Existing flow modified to call the splitting s=
ervice post-conversion&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"9a3ffcc3ff64">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"c1d0c987748a"><strong>3.2 Process Flow</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"87047046-4060-476d-a983-c7ba171691fd">
<li local-id=3D"34936f4d-beb7-403f-894d-daba2427bfe9">
<p local-id=3D"a8be2e1c3b99">Quote-to-Order conversion creates Order and Or=
derItems&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"43e322cd-d28c-4686-afef-9e4fbcef6bad">
<li local-id=3D"c38d8222-89ff-4752-a803-e1f8ee02c1aa">
<p local-id=3D"43016cff93b9">Flow calls PowerOrderSplittingService with Ord=
er ID&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"e5f23784-3a14-41a1-b22b-902c6c3d80e8">
<li local-id=3D"451aa3de-3def-41bf-a011-eb4c53f9f6c8">
<p local-id=3D"73d49da6341e">Service queries OrderItems where Product Solut=
ion_Group__c =3D 'Power' AND Quantity &gt; 1&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"bc71c8b2-5350-4457-ab0a-4d47bffeaacb">
<li local-id=3D"1d7dea44-6f5a-4c88-b17a-cf332b1963db">
<p local-id=3D"c3228f01a3d9">For each qualifying line, determine split type=
 from Product.Power_Split_Type__c&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"4444b969-11ab-49c2-97ba-0ec6d9a66697">
<li local-id=3D"e3b47fe7-9791-4d4b-a7df-ef1052ac1081">
<p local-id=3D"11c4482284ac">Clone Hardware records (if 'Order Line and Har=
dware' type)&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"6" local-id=3D"891dbdf1-782b-42ba-b682-6db84a4ff8b9">
<li local-id=3D"c6fbb2b0-2aad-4ecc-bdc6-3d62288d1176">
<p local-id=3D"7f6fcc5dae97">Clone Partition records (always)&nbsp;</p></li=
>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"7" local-id=3D"3806b270-e06b-4ef1-8b0e-a8c4b42c7f67">
<li local-id=3D"8657f1ea-1ff5-42c9-8df0-e7ce26ab2b6e">
<p local-id=3D"95af1d2982fa">Create new OrderItems with quantity=3D1, distr=
ibuted amounts, and proper references&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"8" local-id=3D"3fd486d0-929b-4ca3-854b-1c3caee46623">
<li local-id=3D"79582577-6117-4dcb-aecf-859561b8c702">
<p local-id=3D"ac39ae520c17">Update original OrderItem quantity to 1&nbsp;<=
/p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"9" local-id=3D"9acd676a-0cd1-482f-8921-119f16f2b11d">
<li local-id=3D"f8bc055f-29d7-45f1-a928-6a4ebff6e5c5">
<p local-id=3D"2c732278a375">Return result with success status and counts&n=
bsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"361dd1bce0f9">&nbsp;</p>
