<p local-id=3D"a2eda01ffcd2">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"60bc733bf154"><strong>4.2 Entity Relationship</strong>&nbsp;=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"548eae3a5b7f">After splitting, the data model relationships =
are as follows:&nbsp;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"210cffd0-effa-4a0e-bc3c-2c782f7311ca">
<li local-id=3D"5c254f7c-5d24-4307-8419-5e046da385c7">
<p local-id=3D"88e982d4f32c">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrder (1) =E2=86=92 OrderIte=
m (many) - Standard relationship=E2=80=8B&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"6ad9d687-bbd4-48bb-90af-57089c506bd8">
<li local-id=3D"b5b8b21a-c51a-4d9f-9802-14582511b230">
<p local-id=3D"41ebd00c62c5">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrderItem =E2=86=92 Hardware=
__c - Either shared (many:1) or unique (1:1) based on split type=E2=80=8B&n=
bsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"c773ac7d-f935-4c6b-87a9-c63f2c4df0ec">
<li local-id=3D"34635f2e-8a67-435e-8275-6602f51f3d21">
<p local-id=3D"35ed77517151">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrderItem =E2=86=92 Partitio=
n__c - Always unique (1:1) after splitting=E2=80=8B&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"5290b5c5-b4df-4023-baf0-3de70b2312df">
<li local-id=3D"7d86590f-6d6f-4418-ab4f-68bd9eab0aff">
<p local-id=3D"b48162493a69">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrderItem =E2=86=92 Original=
_Order_Item__c - Links split lines to original for audit trail=E2=80=8B&nbs=
p;</p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"bbaaa4f36f2e">
<li local-id=3D"0a1464f499ba">
<p local-id=3D"71d3bce86b9f"><strong>Technical Implementation</strong>&nbsp=
;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"d1f2644fd17c"><strong>5.1 Apex Service Class</strong>&nbsp;<=
/p>
