<p local-id=3D"bcb38d9916b0">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"234a3f868049"><strong>5.2 Key Design Decisions</strong>&nbsp=
;</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"9c3f19ae-b020-418b-a92c-4ce84137f2a6">
<li local-id=3D"e0f9eeb6-fe1a-4b8f-b72e-14a31c0b1a13">
<p local-id=3D"4249f54551e3">Bulk-safe design: All DML operations are bulki=
fied to handle orders with many line items&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"c87ff8c8-36f4-4872-90c1-725d30b9d3e4">
<li local-id=3D"aa84ee8e-d169-414c-a774-fe727149bf3c">
<p local-id=3D"c50bab0cc281">Transaction integrity: Entire operation runs i=
n a single transaction with automatic rollback on failure&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"ed1bbe52-3d81-4474-9f4d-d640e1113e46">
<li local-id=3D"635c17c5-0dba-4c17-b30d-9509942c320b">
<p local-id=3D"db4c53aa9236">Quantity preservation: Original quantities sto=
red in a Map before modification to prevent data corruption&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"ee44a893-c7b2-49bd-bc9c-e51a06c62fee">
<li local-id=3D"db7088d1-7caf-48a4-8084-37b153371d26">
<p local-id=3D"f2824174387f">Even distribution: Currency amounts rounded to=
 2 decimal places with remainder applied to first split line&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"a0229913-665b-452d-a68b-4537788db8fb">
<li local-id=3D"ad03f8c2-9a16-48a6-8e17-33b959a41c4f">
<p local-id=3D"57b68068322d">Audit trail: Original_Order_Item__c and Is_Spl=
it_Line__c fields enable full traceability&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"350438edaaef"><strong>5.3 Governor Limit Considerations</str=
ong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"714ec23b0108">The service is designed to operate within Sale=
sforce governor limits:&nbsp;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"cf5f0171-804c-4eb8-811a-c8bf7cf478ce">
<li local-id=3D"b209da8f-1638-49dc-9200-ec973c795f74">
<p local-id=3D"4d5ddc2a86e9">SOQL queries: Minimized to 4 queries regardles=
s of data volume&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"fe7acd79-c863-460f-bfda-cca9d44d2dc1">
<li local-id=3D"1e038231-93b0-4256-95d1-1af5c464ab38">
<p local-id=3D"56a127ab2b4d">DML statements: Batched inserts/updates for Ha=
rdware, Partitions, and OrderItems&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"ed68da31-b9d1-4770-9ce7-cb77ae72ed3f">
<li local-id=3D"d93cee62-057e-4d31-8677-b34c6d0ffc10">
<p local-id=3D"34dad29ca6d5">CPU time: Linear complexity O(n) where n =3D t=
otal order items to split&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"acca5a966fef">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"1924eac0ed27">&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"8" local-id=3D"dcf42bd49e88">
<li local-id=3D"8088994f7b92">
<p local-id=3D"3f20df4faa53"><strong>Appendix</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
